{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08、S11、S12等短停留段落里，话与即时感受提示切换较密，观众可能忙着追屏幕而顾不上听音乐；Y的左右分区更稳定，扫读相对从容。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X最突出的优势是既让人抓住人物每一阶段的核心心理，又保留了心理转折背后的具体原因，例如亲近的回忆越鲜活，当初受过的委屈反而越容易涌上来，以及他甚至害怕自己会因为孤单而重新忍受那些委屈。这些细节让人物的矛盾不是简单的反复犹豫，而是有来由、有变化、有递进；配合随音乐出现的具体感受，前后也形成了完整的情绪轨迹。Y的叙事更紧凑、双栏更方便扫读，但部分重要的心理因果和音乐表现被概括掉了，普通观众虽然容易理解故事，却较难真正感受到人物内心的细腻变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa59f14c-8806-4075-8edb-8be45d1fc2cf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T232153449357Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:23:40.927703+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0a2d9bd41e5adecb90387a126fc6ca346f6d1be6291d1c56d6fd26e70f2a60c0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc